<title>HONG KONG: Joyce says opens third Hugo Boss shop.</title>
<headline>Joyce says opens third Hugo Boss shop.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Joyce Boutique Holdings Ltd said on Friday it had opened its third Hugo Boss AG exclusive store in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The fashion retailer said in a statement it would open three more Hugo Boss stores between late 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>It also planned to open a flagship store at the Hong Kong Station under construction in the Central business district.</p>
<p>The rail station will link the territory's new airport to Central.</p>
<p>Joyce holds the exclusive rights to retail the German firm's fashion goods in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
